msgstr "CamSpy obtenue.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_060"
msgid ""
"There's no way through while those \n"
"lasers are active.\n"
msgstr ""
"C'est impossible de passer avec tous \n"
"ces lasers activés.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_061"
msgid ""
"That must be the meeting room up ahead. \n"
"Time to use the CamSpy.\n"
msgstr ""
"La salle de réunion doit être droit devant. \n"
"Il est temps d'utiliser la CamSpy.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_062"
msgid ""
"The safe's heavily encrypted. \n"
"The decoder's gonna take a little longer.\n"
msgstr ""
"La combinaison du coffre est très complexe. \n"
"Le décodeur va mettre plus de temps.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_063"
msgid ""
"Time to leave! Let's get to the door I set \n"
"up earlier.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il faut partir maintenant! Je retourne vite à \n"
"la porte de tout à l'heure.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_064"
msgid "Mission critical object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_065"
msgid ""
"Stand back, Joanna. We'll create your escape \n"
"route.\n"
msgstr ""
"Reculez, Joanna. Nous allons vous ouvrir \n"
"un passage.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_066"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_DEPO_067"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

