msgid "Detonator\n"
msgstr "Détonateur\n"

#. "L_DEPO_069"
msgid "Detonator\n"
msgstr "Détonateur\n"

#. "L_DEPO_070"
msgid "Picked up Detonator.\n"
msgstr "Détonateur obtenue.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_071"
msgid "CamSpy has been destroyed - abort mission.\n"
msgstr "CamSpy détruite - abandonner la mission.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_072"
msgid ""
"We've recovered the sapient from Carrington \n"
"and altered its programming. It no longer \n"
"has a personality, so there will be no \n"
"further incidents.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous avons récupéré le Sapiens chez Carrington \n"
"et changé son programme. Il n'a plus de \n"
"personnalité. Cela évitera de futurs \n"
"incidents.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_073"
msgid ""
"This will reduce its efficiency. My team will \n"
"have to take it to the core themselves. This \n"
"will endanger them. You should have \n"
"anticipated that the sapient might develop \n"
"a troublesome moral code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cela réduira son efficacité. Mon équipe le \n"
"mènera au centre. Ils prendront donc \n"
"des risques inutiles. Vous auriez dû \n"
"prévoir ce développement de conscience chez \n"
"le Sapiens.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_074"
msgid ""
"No one could have predicted that! And I \n"
"resent being singled out for blame! \n"
"What about him?\n"
msgstr ""
"Comment prévoir une chose pareille?! \n"
"Et pourquoi suis-je la seule à porter \n"
"le chapeau? Et lui alors?\n"

#. "L_DEPO_075"
msgid ""
"The President turned down your request for \n"
"the loan of the Pelagic II?\n"
msgstr ""
"Le Président a-t-il refusé votre demande \n"
"de prêt du Pelagic II?\n"

#. "L_DEPO_076"
msgid ""
"Could it be you overestimated your \n"
"influence over him?\n"
msgstr ""
"Pensiez-vous avoir tant d'influence \n"
"sur lui?\n"

#. "L_DEPO_077"
msgid ""
"No! Perhaps I underestimated his resolve. \n"
"We have a contingency plan ready to go, \n"
"and we will move as soon as the Presidential \n"
"entourage arrives at the air base. All I \n"
"need from the President is a tissue sample.\n"
msgstr ""
"Non! J'ai peut-être sous-estimé son côté \n"
"intègre. Mais nous avons un plan de \n"
"secours. Nous agirons dès que l'équipe \n"
"présidentielle arrivera à la base aérienne. \n"
"Je n'ai besoin que d'un échantillon de la \n"
"peau du Président.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_078"
msgid ""
"Ha! Assuming you don't get any interference. \n"
"If Carrington has pieced together enough of \n"
"this, he will have called for reinforcements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pff! En admettant que vous ne fassiez pas \n"
"tout foirer. Si Carrington en apprend \n"
"suffisamment, il appellera des renforts.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_079"
msgid ""
"There will be no outside help for \n"
"Mr. Carrington. The technology you gave us \n"
"is installed in Nevada and fully operational. \n"
"We can intercept any craft they use.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mr. Carrington ne bénéficiera d'aucune aide \n"
"extérieure. L'équipement que vous nous \n"
"avez offert est installé au Nevada et est \n"
"opérationnel. Nous pourrons ainsi intercepter \n"
"leurs appareils.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_080"
msgid ""
"Then the devices we gave you are working \n"
"correctly? Good. Because we believe \n"
"anything which does not work correctly \n"
"should be destroyed. Consider that as you \n"
"follow your 'backup plans.'\n"
msgstr ""
"Notre dispositif fonctionne donc \n"
"correctement? Bien. Notre philosophie \n"
"est de détruire tout ce qui ne veut pas \n"
"fonctionner. Souvenez-vous-en pendant \n"
"l'exécution de votre 'plan de secours.'\n"

#. "L_DEPO_081"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark reporting in! Prepare to \n"
"receive a download of the meeting data. \n"
"Priority request for an Institute Support \n"
"Team to protect the President before he \n"
"goes to Alaska.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agent Dark au rapport! Préparez-vous à \n"
"recevoir les données de la réunion. \n"
"Demande prioritaire d'une équipe de \n"
"l'Institut pour protéger le Président \n"
"avant son départ pour l'Alaska.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_082"
msgid ""
"No time for that now, Agent Dark. There's \n"
"been a development during radio silence. \n"
"The craft carrying those 'friends' I was \n"
"talking about was shot down over Nevada. \n"
"The weapon responsible was fired from \n"
"Area 51... that's where the survivors and \n"
"debris will have been taken. You're to \n"
"prep for immediate dispatch when you \n"
"return here. Carrington out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons pas le temps, Agent Dark. \n"
"Il y a du nouveau depuis le silence \n"
"radio. L'appareil transportant les \n"
"'amis' dont je parlais plus tôt a été \n"
"abattu au-dessus du Nevada. Le tir \n"
"provenait du Secteur 51, là où les \n"
"rescapés et les débris ont dû être amenés. \n"
"Revenez au poste et préparez-vous \n"
"pour un départ imminent. \n"
"Carrington, terminé.\n"

#. "L_DEPO_083"
msgid "Area 51? But what about the President?\n"
msgstr "Secteur 51? Et le Président alors?\n"
